---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import n2Image from '../assets/n2.svg';
---

<section aria-labelledby="detailed-feature-title" class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-20 md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:py-28">
		<div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 ">
			<Image
				class="h-auto w-full rounded-sm"
				src={n2Image}
				alt="A system structure linked to a matrix of engineering interfaces"
				format="webp"
				width={960}
				sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 560px, (min-width: 1024px) calc((100vw - 96px) / 2), calc(100vw - 72px)"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
		</div>

		<div>
			<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-orange-700">One connected system model</p>
			<h2 id="detailed-feature-title" class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
				See the structure behind every engineering decision
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
				Bring system breakdowns, reference designations and interface relationships into one clear view. SEC-Hub helps your team understand how components fit together and keep project information connected as the design evolves.
			</p>
			<ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
				<li class="border-l-2 border-orange-500 pl-4">
					<strong class="font-semibold text-slate-950">Navigate with context.</strong>
					Follow parent-child structures without losing sight of the wider system.
				</li>
				<li class="border-l-2 border-orange-500 pl-4">
					<strong class="font-semibold text-slate-950">Make interfaces visible.</strong>
					Review connections and dependencies across engineering disciplines.
				</li>
				<li class="border-l-2 border-orange-500 pl-4">
					<strong class="font-semibold text-slate-950">Keep information aligned.</strong>
					Give teams a shared foundation for consistent, traceable decisions.
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>